1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,300
(Leonard:)Suppose there are worse ways
to spend a Friday night.

2
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,340
(Leonard:)None come to mind.

3
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,950
(Sheldon:)Look at this stamp.
On what authority

4
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:18,350
(Sheldon:)are they permitted to
mutilate patrons as they enter?

5
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,400
(Amy:)I'm sure it'll wash off.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,020
(Sheldon:)Little comfort tonight.

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,090
(Sheldon:)I look like a Hell's Angel.

8
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,560
(Amy:)There's Zack.

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,230
(Sheldon:)Are you sure this is
what you want to do?

10
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:32,130
It's not what I want to do;

11
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:35,000
(Amy:)it's what I have to do.

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,100
(Sheldon:)Go, Amy Farrah Fowler.

13
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:40,270
(Sheldon:)Follow your endocrine system.

14
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,940
(Amy:)Thank you, Sheldon.
You're a good friend.

15
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,410
(Sheldon:)Please don't drag this out.

16
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,920
(Sheldon:)This is never going to come off.

17
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,390
(Amy:)Excuse me?

18
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:57,190
Zack, I am Amy Farrah Fowler.
We met the other night.

